WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.073 --> 00:00:27.553
Once upon a time, there was a young princess.

2
00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:29.928
Her name was Snow White.

3
00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:36.066
She had white skin, red cheeks, and black hair.

4
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:46.922
Snow White's mother died long ago.

5
00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:49.625
So Snow White lived alone with her father.

6
00:00:49.626 --> 00:00:54.645
They were very happy together.

7
00:00:54.646 --> 00:00:59.849
Then one day the king fell in love.

8
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.699
Soon the kingdom had a new queen.

9
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:21.636
And Snow White had a new mother.

10
00:01:21.637 --> 00:01:27.394
Snow White tried to play with her new stepmother.

11
00:01:27.395 --> 00:01:39.784
"Go away!" The queen slammed her bedroom door.

12
00:01:39.785 --> 00:01:43.682
Alone, the queen looked into her magic mirror.

13
00:01:43.683 --> 00:01:47.893
"Mirror, mirror on the wall," she asked.

14
00:01:47.894 --> 00:01:55.210
"Who is the fairest of them all?"

15
00:01:55.211 --> 00:01:58.750
"My Lady," the mirror said.

16
00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:07.902
"You are the fairest woman in the kingdom."

17
00:02:07.903 --> 00:02:13.884
Years passed, and Snow White grew up.

18
00:02:13.885 --> 00:02:19.134
She often walked through the village.

19
00:02:19.135 --> 00:02:23.936
She sang songs with children.

20
00:02:23.937 --> 00:02:29.387
She gave food to poor people.

21
00:02:29.388 --> 00:02:33.105
Everyone loved the young princess.

22
00:02:33.106 --> 00:02:37.007
"Snow White is so beautiful," a woman said.

23
00:02:37.008 --> 00:02:42.572
"I wish I could marry her," a man said.

24
00:02:42.573 --> 00:02:46.034
But the queen didn't like Snow White.

25
00:02:46.035 --> 00:02:50.411
She never spent time with the girl.

26
00:02:50.412 --> 00:02:54.862
Instead she talked to her mirror.

27
00:02:54.863 --> 00:03:02.279
"Mirror! I'm the most beautiful woman, right?"

28
00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.520
"My Lady," the mirror said.

29
00:03:05.521 --> 00:03:11.086
"You are indeed quite fair.

30
00:03:11.087 --> 00:03:18.752
But now there's someone more beautiful."
